  "dct:description": [
    {
      "@value": "Bilingual, machine-readable observation prompts for 12 family-travel settings. The taxonomy provides 84 targets and three non-age, non-ability participation modes without requesting names, ages, destinations, locations, photos, itineraries or completion records.",
      "@language": "en"
    },
    {
      "@value": "適用 12 種親子旅行情境的英繁雙語機器可讀觀察提示，包含 84 個觀察目標與三種不按年齡或能力分級的參與方式，不要求姓名、年齡、目的地、位置、照片、行程或完成紀錄。",
